flowchart LR
  accTitle: Job processing — illustrative example
  accDescr: A submitted job waits in a queue. A worker runs it. Successful jobs produce a saved result. Failed jobs retry while attempts remain, otherwise their status becomes failed.
  A[Submit job] --> B[Queue]
  B --> C[Worker runs job]
  C --> D{Succeeded?}
  D -->|Yes| E[Save result]
  D -->|No| F{Attempts remain?}
  F -->|Yes: retry| B
  F -->|No| G[Mark failed]
